 {r}←ErrorInRumba server;qdmx;msg;TRAP
 :If 0=#.⎕NC'ErrorParms'
 :OrIf 0=##.##.⎕NC'HandleError'
     qdmx←⎕DMX
     msg←'Rumba Error: ',⍕2↑qdmx.DM
     :Trap 0 ⍝ Here a trap 0 is okay because we don't want `LogRumba` to break the app no matter what; Kai
         {}server LogRumba msg
     :EndTrap
 :EndIf

 :If IsRideSession                          ⍝ Kai: If connected to Ride we don't ⎕OFF for obvious reasons
     TRAP←⎕TRAP
     ⎕TRAP←0 'S'
     ∘∘∘                                    ⍝ Check it out, dear ⎕AN
 :EndIf

 ⎕OFF 125                                   ⍝ Kai: Enforce restart
⍝Done
